# Whitelist: the image gets only what the meeting transcriber needs.
# Recordings and voice clips (data/), voiceprints (cache/), secrets (.env) and the
# local meeting.ini must never reach an image shared with colleagues.
*
!pyproject.toml
!poetry.lock
!docker/
!src/paths.py
!src/asr/
!src/utils/
!src/meeting/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
docker/*.tar
